 de host en die heeft de volgende dag iemand gestuurd die dit heeft geprobeerd te maken. Helaas is het alleen de dag erna weer kapot gegaan. Wij hebben als oplossing de rest van de nachten met het matras op de grond geslapen\nHet tweede dingetje is de beveiliging die niet vriendelijk was. Wij kregen het gevoel dat we niet welkom waren. Tijdens ons verblijf kregen we ook meerdere keren de vraag tot wanneer we verbleven. Wij hebben 1 keer iets gezegd over de onderburen die een erg luide hond hadden waarop wij als reactie kregen dat zij ‘kopers’ zijn en wij maar ‘huurders’. Dit hoort natuurlijk niet\nBuiten deze twee punten was het verblijf goed en aan te raden. Wij zullen echter niet meer terug komen.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:10.000000Z"},{"id":5194310,"review":"شكرا والبتوفيق","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z"},{"id":5206506,"review":"Excelente lugar para las familias, un apartamento enorme con todas las comodidades necesarias, el anfitrión fue muy amable y nos ayudó con todo, lo recomiendo 100%","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:12.000000Z"},{"id":5217939,"review":"Fantastic property and location. Arranged driver picked us up at the airport with a sign and a smile, and provided suggested activities, etc. Booking was simple. Check in was convenient. I would highly recommend. Great place at a great price.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5232873,"review":"Thanks","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5236048,"review":"مكان جميل ومسكن رائع","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5239000,"review":"مسكن واسع ورائع ونظيف جدا ومكان محترم وتجربة موفقة الحمد لله .. شكرا لكم","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5260919,"review":"It’s clean","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5269078,"review":"كل شيء جميل من حيث النظافة والاستقبال والتواصل والرقي في التعامل","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5278844,"review":"المكان جميل جداً تماماً مثل الصور هادئ ونظيف","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5305108,"review":"De communicatie verliep zeer vlot. We werden goed onthaald. Het appartement was zeer ruim en proper.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5314119,"review":"الشقة جميلة من الداخل ولكن لا يوجد شبكة نهااائياً في جميع انواع الشبكات ، لا يمكن الاتصال من الداخل بل توجب علي الخروج من الشقة والنزول بالهارج لأتمكن من اجراء اتصال او الاستمتاع بالانترنت \n\n- ابلغتني الموظفة أن الشقة مطله على المسبح ولذلك سيكون السعر مرتفع قليلاً ولكن عند تسجيل الوصول اتضح ان الشقة ليست مطلة على المسبح ولا توجد في اي اتصال ب اي شبكة \n- فكانت اقامتي فيها لمدة ٤ ايام تعد معاناة بالنسبة لي","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5318379,"review":"الشقة نظيفة جدا","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5320344,"review":"Good stay","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5322598,"review":"Excellent to unwind after a busy week in old Cairo before catching our flight","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5348235,"review":"المكان ممتاز ونظيف ، اوصي به بشدة.\nشكراً لكم على استظافتكم الرائعة، لن تكون اخر مرة","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5384590,"review":"Good place","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5446562,"review":"Positive:\nالشقه جميله والكومباوند انيق\n\nNegative:\nلا توجد خدمه وضع الشنط عندهم في حال الوصول المبكر .. لا يوجد شخص تتفاهم معه بمجرد ما تدخل الشقه ما احد يخدمك ولا ينظفوا ولا فيه مناديل .. طلبت منهم تصليح الغساله رد علي بعد يومين .. النت ما يشتغل كلمتهم بلا فايده وبذلك ماراح يشتغل حتى التلفزيون بما انه مافيه نت .. الميكرويف ما يشتغل ولا يسخن .. الاجهزه مناظر فقط افضل شي مكينه القهوه ومسخنة التوست .. عند الخروج مافيه موظف حتى يشيل الشنط لما كلمت حارس الامن جلس في مكانه ولا تحرك .","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5478791,"review":"Positive:\nGood size and location.\n\nNegative:\nFaulty remotes, door locks, and washing machine.\nCouches weren’t very comfortable. Some deliveries had trouble finding the place.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5489780,"review":"مكان جميل وهادئ وكانت الشقه فوق الوصف كذالك سهوله في التواصل مع المالك شي من الخيال تبارك الرحمن يحتاج زياره مره أخرى شكراً جزيلاً لكم 💕","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5536337,"review":"It was a great experience and very nice and clean place to stay for a short vacation i highly recommend to anyone visiting cairo to stay here","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5577019,"review":".","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5603717,"review":"Amazing apartment well furnished and was super beautiful \n\nI have some comments:\nNo access to free parking and you have to pay additional for each time you enter the parking\n\nThe pool is very nice but also not included in your reservation \n\nThe mobile network is always poor\n\nBathrooms drainage was not okay\n\nOtherwise it was one of the best apartments I ever rented","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5628620,"review":"مريح وهادي ومرتب يستاهل","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5737814,"review":"Two words. Great place","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5749007,"review":"المضيف متعاون، الشقة لا توجد بها تغطية هاتف ولكن يوجد بها إنترنت، عند انقطاع الإنترنت يكون التواصل صعب جداً، الشقة نظيفة بها عيب واحد في النظافة وهو ان المناشف بها بقع تجعل من المقزز استعمالها، اما باقي الشقة فهي نظيفة، انصح بالسكن هنا في حالة عدم الحاجة الي تغطية الهاتف أثناء السكن.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5774463,"review":"لقد كانت إقامة جميلة جدا","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5862264,"review":"Nous avons passé un excellent séjour dans votre logement. Tout était parfait, notamment la propreté : rien à dire, 10/10 ! Le personnel a toujours été à notre écoute, et les personnes à l’entrée assurent très bien la sécurité. L’endroit n’est pas loin de l’aéroport. Merci !","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5862852,"review":"Super séjour chez Xuru Stays ! Accueil chaleureux, communication parfaite et logement impeccable. Je recommande vivement","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5870336,"review":"شكرا","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5884093,"review":"Der Aufenthalt war super. Dies war nicht mein erster Aufenthalt mit Xuru - und ich bin jedes Mal erneut zufrieden. \n\nDer Service ist ausgezeichnet - Fragen werden in der Regel innerhalb von wenigen Minuten beantwortet. \n\nBei meinen Aufenthalten in Ägypten ist Xuru stets meine erste Wahl.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5890761,"review":"أنا أحب هذه الشقة، نظيفة ومريحة.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5894993,"review":"We had a very comfortable stay and the apartment was clean and well prepared. It is located in a compound with 24-hour security at the entrance. The host was quick to respond to any issues and the team who assisted us were very polite and helpful.\n\nJust a small note for future guests: there are stairs at the entrance, so it’s good to be prepared to carry your luggage. Assistance may be needed.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5916303,"review":"Wunderschöne Wohnung mit tollem Personal. Immer erreichbar, falls notwendig. Tolle Ausstattung der Wohnung und schöne ruhige Umgebung.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5991252,"review":"Amazing hosting team, great place, value good value for the money","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6074030,"review":"Great place. Quite clean and spacious. Luxury finishing with great price. Liked the costumer service prompt responses and solutions to any issues raised.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6083787,"review":"Very good spot","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z"},{"id":6099611,"review":"not recommended","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6104402,"review":"رائع","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6106407,"review":"Positive:\nجميلة جداً\n\nNegative:\nالدخول متعب شوي لان مافيه استقبال","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6111950,"review":"We hebben een heel fijn verblijf gehad. Het appartement is precies zoals op de foto’s. Een mooi, ruim, modern en van alle gemakken voorzien. Alles was netjes en comfortabel, waardoor we ons meteen thuis voelden. De host reageerde altijd snel en was erg vriendelijk en behulpzaam. De communicatie verliep soepel en duidelijk. Zeker een aanrader voor iedereen die op zoek is naar een prettig en comfortabel verblijf!","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6129963,"review":"The place was as expected, and extremely clean!","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6166515,"review":"Très belle appartement et propre. Il manque juste des ustensiles et couverts pour cuisiner.","rental_id":216760,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}